    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Role:Tutorial_Role_002:37ade73e",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Tutorial_Role",
        "key": "Tutorial_Role_002",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Role:Tutorial_Role_002:37ade73e",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Role:Tutorial_Role_002:37ade73e",
        "jp_sha256": "1b17ed3e98e44025d0fad2d10e59da3242958d704fc19eff586c1a4b78646ca7",
        "official_en_sha256": "6dc57ba1b8a3e76572d1dc05fda2219ced8a416c230b4893542482f7233bae30"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ロールとはキャラクターの特徴を示したものです。\r\n\r\nたとえば、ディフェンダーのレインは仲間を守るのが得意で\r\nヒーラーのフィーナは回復が得意です。\r\n\r\n・アタッカー：　　ダメージを与えるのが得意\r\n・ヒーラー：　　　回復することでパーティを支える\r\n・ディフェンダー：仲間を守って戦う\r\n・ブレイカー：　　ブレイクゲージを削るのが得意\r\n・エンハンサー：　仲間を強化し、戦況を有利にする\r\n・ジャマー：　　　敵を妨害し、戦況を有利にする",
        "official_en": "Roles define each character’s area of expertise.\r\n\r\nFor example, Rain is a Sentinel who excels at\r\nprotecting his allies, while Fina is a Medic who\r\nfocuses on restoring health.\r\n\r\nCommando: Excels at dealing damage.\r\nMedic: Supports the party with healing.\r\nSentinel: Protects allies.\r\nBreaker: Specializes in staggering enemies.\r\nSynergist: Buffs allies to gain an advantage in battle.\r\nSaboteur: Disrupts enemies to turn the tide.",
        "real_en": "Roles describe each character’s strengths.\r\n\r\nFor example, Rain is a Defender who excels at\r\nprotecting allies, while Fina is a Healer who\r\nspecializes in healing.\r\n\r\nAttacker: Excels at dealing damage.\r\nHealer: Supports the party through healing.\r\nDefender: Fights while protecting allies.\r\nBreaker: Excels at reducing the Break gauge.\r\nEnhancer: Strengthens allies to gain an advantage.\r\nJammer: Disrupts enemies to gain an advantage."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
