    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Role:Tutorial_Role_004:324a6fa5",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Tutorial_Role",
        "key": "Tutorial_Role_004",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Role:Tutorial_Role_004:324a6fa5",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Tutorial_Role:Tutorial_Role_004:324a6fa5",
        "jp_sha256": "4bce8dfe89ae0eeeac3ea123abfb9e091fd682c794abe6b506224127e608650d",
        "official_en_sha256": "ebb6f0dd27cebd501fdb5d14f92f96c6f5b3a86170a0b8d858ff3e2d24465b98"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ロールはビジョンにも設定されているので、\r\nキャラクターとの組み合わせが重要です。\r\n\r\nたとえば、ウォーリアオブライトはディフェンダーのロールを\r\nもっているので、同じディフェンダーのレインと相性がいいです。\r\n\r\nもちろん、異なるロールを組み合わせ、攻撃ができるヒーラーなどの\r\nオリジナリティあふれる多様なパーティをつくることもできます。\r\n\r\nあなたの考える、理想のパーティをつくっていきましょう！",
        "official_en": "Visions also have roles, so it’s important to consider\r\nthis when pairing them with party members.\r\n\r\nFor example, Warrior of Light and Rain both have\r\nSentinel roles, meaning they naturally complement\r\neach other.\r\n\r\nThat said, there is nothing stopping you from\r\nmixing and matching various roles—\r\nwhy not make a Medic character who’s also effective\r\non the offensive?\r\n\r\nIt’s your party, go crazy!",
        "real_en": "Visions have roles too, so it matters how you\r\npair them with characters.\r\n\r\nFor example, Warrior of Light is a Defender,\r\nso he is a good match for Rain, who is also\r\na Defender.\r\n\r\nOf course, you can also mix different roles\r\nto make all kinds of unique parties, such as\r\na Healer who can attack as well.\r\n\r\nBuild the party that suits you best!"
      },
